        "Morax",
        "Rex Lapis",
        "Zhongli",
        "Geo Archon"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Azhdaha: Zhongli (Morax)",
      "content": "Morax unearthed Azhdaha, gave him sight and made the contract: Azhdaha could live among people, but would be sealed again if he ever endangered Liyue's order. They fought in the Archon War, and Azhdaha was among Morax's staunchest allies. When erosion ate at the dragon's mind, Morax tried to help with his own power, then personally fought him from The Chasm to Nantianmen and sealed him.",
