    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Jiu",
        "Ajiu"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Azhdaha: Jiu",
      "content": "Jiu is a girl-shaped vessel of Azhdaha's power, with short blue hair, grey eyes behind golden glasses and a dark green dress. Before 1.5 she was an ordinary-looking NPC by the Dragon-Queller, scornful of Rex Lapis and promising a resurrection. She is fully Azhdaha, the embodiment of his rage, not a possessed human. Because she appears as a child, most passers-by dismissed her.",
