    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Dragon-Queller",
        "Nantianmen",
        "the seal",
        "contract with Morax"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Azhdaha: The Contract and the Seal",
      "content": "The Dragon-Queller is the great tree with blue veins between Mt. Hulao and Nantianmen that seals him. Developer commentary says the tree is his tail, and Jiu says that after thousands of years the tree and the beast would become one. A stone tablet at its foot warns: life endures because of the adepti, and on this site lies an evil dragon not to be disturbed.",
