    "4": {
      "uid": 4,
      "key": [
        "The Chasm",
        "Dragonfall",
        "Tianqiu Valley"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Azhdaha: The Chasm and Dragonfall",
      "content": "The Chasm is where miners overworked the Ley Lines, hurting Azhdaha, and where he first attacked. Morax fought him there, and the battle moved north to Nantianmen. The clashing elemental energy produced Dragonfall, a rare ore, nearly mined out centuries ago.",
