    "5": {
      "uid": 5,
      "key": [
        "erosion",
        "eroded"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Azhdaha: Erosion",
      "content": "In the quest, Erosion is described as the world's greatest destroyer of memories. Stone memories fade over eons, and only those rooted in powerful emotion survive. In Azhdaha's case it ground his consciousness down until he forgot Morax's face and his love for Liyue, and became aggressive. Zhongli says he is not immune either.",
