    "8": {
      "uid": 8,
      "key": [
        "Moonchase Festival",
        "Marchosius",
        "Stove God"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Azhdaha: Moonchase Festival flashback",
      "content": "During the limited-time Moonlight Merriment event (2.1), a flashback cinematic shows Azhdaha gazing at the night sky with Marchosius, the Stove God, riding on his shoulder, among other figures of the ancient world. It is a glimpse of his friendly past, not a sign that he is awake.",
