    "9": {
      "uid": 9,
      "key": [
        "Beneath the Dragon-Queller",
        "Beneath the Ancient Tree",
        "Trounce Domain",
        "weekly boss"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Azhdaha: Weekly boss domain",
      "content": "The weekly boss is a replay of the fight: Azhdaha's Geo attacks, then the added Hydro or Pyro, then Cryo or Electro, drawn through his limbs and then his tail. The combination rotates weekly. Defeating every variation grants an achievement. This is a game mechanic, framed in-lore as the Traveler's memory.",
